<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cousins Properties cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cousins Properties cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Thursday it had cut its rating for Cousins Properties Inc to near-term neutral from near-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch kept its long-term buy rating for the shares.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Atlanta company opened off 7/8 to 26-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
